    "story": {
      "html": "<span class=\"who\">Aonishiki</span> went from Maegashira 15 to Ozeki in six bashos, one of the fastest climbs in our records. He won two Emperor's Cups before he turned 22 and a third at 22. Two of the three came as a Sekiwake. The first was Kyushu 2025, on the way up. He took the second as an Ozeki at Hatsu 2026. The third came at Nagoya 2026, the same tournament he had dropped to Sekiwake after losing his Ozeki rank; he won the Cup and took the rank straight back for Aki.",
